 exact post-import rollback equality. This does not rebuild or change frozen release source 7945f956, the canonical publication input, or the operator publication hold.\n\nValidation: root independently reviewed the producer and patch; 144 script tests passed (exit 0, temporary nonexecuted hash-only fixture removed). Independent Sol review passed the regression plus 12 positive/negative in-memory controls and diff checks. The original failed export is preserved. Actual 7945 receipt readback remains an acceptance gate after hosted checks and integration; no release tag or publication is authorized.\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T15:58:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:58:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2793dd69c9d6c3ae45bd618875f6083b1e3e166b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/pulls/239/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/pulls/239/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/issues/239/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/statuses/4592139422f02fb7bc4fbc3f8e0b612a42551044","head":{"label":"joshyorko:codex/rcc-two-phase-release-20261011","ref":"codex/rcc-two-phase-release-20261011","sha":"4592139422f02fb7bc4fbc3f8e0b612a42551044","user":{"login":"joshyorko","id":54248591,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjQ4NTkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54248591?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko","html_url":"https://github.com/joshyorko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko